  m_text: 'In this game, you play as a giant pair of fingers protecting a poor soul
    trapped in their home being overrun by zombies.


    Tap, swipe, and shake your
    device to kill the zombies before they get to the Poor Soul. If the Poor Soul
    gets attacked too much, they will die and you lose! Survive until your thumbs
    fall off!

'
